    {
      "source": "Returns <a href=\"#ORDER\">3005</a>, which ensures that the <code>CommonCachesTestExecutionListener</code>\nis ordered after the\n<a href=\"DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener</code></a> and before the\n<a href=\"../transaction/TransactionalTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.transaction\"><code>TransactionalTestExecutionListener</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回 <a href=\"#ORDER\">3005</a>，这确保 <code>CommonCachesTestExecutionListener</code> 在 <a href=\"DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener</code></a> 之后且在 <a href=\"../transaction/TransactionalTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.transaction\"><code>TransactionalTestExecutionListener</code></a> 之前执行。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a> value for this listener: 3005.",
      "translation": "此监听器的<a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a>值为：3005。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Clears the resource caches of the <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> since they are\nonly required during the bean initialization phase. Runs after\n<a href=\"DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener</code></a> since dirtying the context will\nclose it and remove it from the context cache, making it unnecessary to clear\nthe associated resource caches.",
      "translation": "清除 `<a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>` 的资源缓存，因为它们在 Bean 初始化阶段之后就不再需要了。此操作在运行于 `<a href=\"DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextTestExecutionListener</code></a>` 之后执行，因为污染上下文会关闭它并将其从上下文缓存中移除，从而使清除相关资源缓存变得不必要。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
